        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2116, Contemporary Dummy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Rectangular Dummy Pocket Door Set comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a dummy mortise that has a cutout to accept a latch from a keyed or privacy pocket door mortise. This makes it able to be used on the inactive side of a pair of sliding doors. The Contemporary Dummy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is available in a wide array of finishes so you'll be able to match your personal style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Dummy Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2114\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2115\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/modern-rectangular-keyed-entry-pocket-door-emtek-2113\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 17/20\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2116-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek 2116 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a dummy set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
